From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Duron27 <duron27@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 21:35:54 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Multiplayer: engine hooks for the support library's
 multiplayer (cpp/openmw-upstream/support/multiplayer)

Edits to OpenMW's own files only: client mods and the built-in script lists at startup (main.cpp), the main menu's
Multiplayer button, player markers on the map and minimap, the openmw.net and openmw.modstore packages and the Lua
handlers they need, animation.setHeadPitch, and text edit additions. The new files (sockets, client mods, the bindings,
the Lua mod, the server) and their build registration live in support/multiplayer, which copies them into the tree.
